// the role and the person in general fintech terms and never how the company works inside; hr_notes is the
// HR-only hiring brief. HR's saved versions in ats_job_templates replace these; deleting HR's version
// brings the default back.
// Text fields are plain text: blank line between paragraphs, "• " bullets, short heading lines.
