    hr_notes: "Standard terms\n• No standard CTC is recorded for this designation yet; agree the figure with management before publishing pay\n• Police clearance certificate and background verification are compulsory before joining\n• Training-month pay, security deposit, probation and notice are set in the offer letter as per the current hiring standard\n\nWhat to test in the interview\n• Candidate call role-play: play a candidate who keeps asking for the salary and joining date. The right answer is to note the question and promise to revert once the HR Manager confirms, without stating or hinting at any figure\n• Referral: an employee calls to complain about their shift manager. The right answer is to log it and refer it to the HR Executive without discussing it\n• Accuracy: a ten-minute exercise entering joining details from sample documents into a sheet; check the error count and whether they flag a missing document\n• Languages: run part of the screening call in Hindi and part in English\n• Confidentiality: ask what they would do if they found salary or appraisal details in a file they were indexing. The right answer is to stop reading and inform the HR Manager\n\nSource: JD Compendium v4.2, BVT/HR/JD/2026/006",
